<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.50 pct, 3-mo 21.27 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.50 pct, 3-mo 21.27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) remained steady at 21.50 percent for the one-month maturity and dropped to 21.27 percent, down 0.01 for the three-month maturity, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
